      "chunk_id": "text_17",
      "quote": "Of the 8,269 records identified by the search engines, 2,527 were automatically marked as duplicates by TERA, which has been manually checked for and confirmed by MK (Fig. 1). During title/abstract screening, another 757 records were identified as duplicates by MK and PSM. A further 1,478 reports were identified by reference list checking and citation tracking. Of the 127 reports sought for retrieval, six were further duplicates and five could not be retrieved, resulting in 116 full texts assessed for eligibility.",
